---
// about.astro
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About & Crediti – Il Progetto 156dotnet (Alfa Romeo 156)"
  description="La storia dell'archivio storico 156dotnet, il tributo ai pionieri Anders e Jeff di alfa156.net, e la missione di preservazione tecnica."
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <div class="relative py-12 lg:py-16 bg-alfa-metal-100 dark:bg-alfa-metal-900 border-b border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-800 transition-colors">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase text-alfa-red-600 dark:text-alfa-red-400">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-alfa-red-600"></span>
          <span class="lang-it">Il Progetto & La Community</span>
          <span class="lang-en">The Project & Community</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="font-display font-extrabold text-3xl sm:text-5xl text-alfa-metal-900 dark:text-white">
          <span class="lang-it">About 156dotnet</span>
          <span class="lang-en">About 156dotnet</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-base text-alfa-metal-600 dark:text-alfa-metal-400 leading-relaxed">
          <span class="lang-it">
            Un ponte tra la gloriosa era d'oro dei forum dei primi anni 2000 e il web moderno: preservare la conoscenza tecnica per mantenere vive le Alfa Romeo 156 su strada.
          </span>
          <span class="lang-en">
            Bridging the golden era of early 2000s forums with the modern web: preserving irreplaceable technical knowledge to keep Alfa Romeo 156s alive on the road.
          </span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-12">
      
      <!-- Section 1: The Heritage -->
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-alfa-metal-900 dark:text-white">
          <span class="lang-it">L'Eredità di <span class="text-alfa-red-600">alfa156.net</span></span>
          <span class="lang-en">The Heritage of <span class="text-alfa-red-600">alfa156.net</span></span>
        </h2>
        
        <div class="text-sm sm:text-base text-alfa-metal-700 dark:text-alfa-metal-300 leading-relaxed space-y-3 lang-it">
          <p>
            Nei primi anni 2000, <strong>alfa156.net</strong> è stato il punto di incontro mondiale per migliaia di proprietari di Alfa 156. Fondato dal norvegese <strong>Anders</strong> e supportato dall'appassionato <strong>Jeff</strong> e da innumerevoli alfisti in tutto il mondo, il sito ha raccolto guide "fai-da-te" straordinarie in un'epoca in cui YouTube e i social non esistevano ancora.
          </p>
          <p>
            Con il passare dei decenni, la chiusura dei vecchi server e il declino dei siti a frame in HTML puro rischiavano di far sparire per sempre preziosissimi dettagli tecnici, schemi di smontaggio introvabili e testimonianze dirette.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="text-sm sm:text-base text-alfa-metal-700 dark:text-alfa-metal-300 leading-relaxed space-y-3 lang-en">
          <p>
            In the early 2000s, <strong>alfa156.net</strong> was the international gathering place for thousands of Alfa 156 owners. Founded by <strong>Anders</strong> in Bergen, Norway, and curated alongside the ever-helpful <strong>Jeff</strong> and passionate contributors worldwide, the website collected invaluable DIY guides long before modern video tutorials existed.
          </p>
          <p>
            As decades passed, discontinued legacy servers and early HTML framesets put these irreplaceable maintenance archives at risk of disappearing forever.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Original 1999/2006 Message from Anders -->
      <section class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-alfa-metal-100 dark:bg-alfa-metal-900/80 border border-alfa-metal-300 dark:border-alfa-metal-700 space-y-3">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-800 pb-2">
          <span class="font-display font-bold text-sm text-alfa-red-600 uppercase tracking-wider">
            <span class="lang-it">Dal fondatore originale (Archivio Storico)</span>
            <span class="lang-en">From the Original Founder (Historical Archive)</span>
          </span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-alfa-metal-500">Anders • Bergen, Norway</span>
        </div>
        <blockquote class="text-xs sm:text-sm italic text-alfa-metal-700 dark:text-alfa-metal-300 leading-relaxed">
          "My name is Anders and I live in Bergen, Norway. This webpage was started to share info about my car. I believe this is the best Alfa 156 site on the net, so I am keeping it alive for you! The ever so helpful Jeff has made step-by-step guides for the Tips section, is a moderator on the forum, and keeps the community updated. Big thanks to all the enthusiasts worldwide who documented their cars."
        </blockquote>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2: What We Did -->
      <section class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-alfa-metal-900 border border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-800 space-y-4 shadow-sm">
        <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-xl text-alfa-metal-900 dark:text-white">
          <span class="lang-it">La Preservazione di 4.449 File</span>
          <span class="lang-en">Preserving 4,449 Historical Files</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-alfa-metal-600 dark:text-alfa-metal-400 leading-relaxed">
          <span class="lang-it">Attraverso un accurato lavoro di recupero e unione tra gli archivi originali e i backup di Archive.org:</span>
          <span class="lang-en">Through careful curation uniting original local archives with Archive.org historical backups:</span>
        </p>
        
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-alfa-metal-700 dark:text-alfa-metal-300 lang-it">
          <li class="flex items-start space-x-2">
            <span class="text-alfa-red-600 font-bold">•</span>
            <span>Sono stati curati e puliti <strong>4.449 file (421 MB totali)</strong> eliminando file corrotti e duplicati.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start space-x-2">
            <span class="text-alfa-red-600 font-bold">•</span>
            <span>Tutte le foto originali passo-passo sono state recuperate e collegate a nuove schede strutturate con gallerie lightbox interattive.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start space-x-2">
            <span class="text-alfa-red-600 font-bold">•</span>
            <span>I file audio diagnostici dei variatori di fase e gli scarichi flessibili sono stati convertiti e integrati con player HTML5 nativi.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-alfa-metal-700 dark:text-alfa-metal-300 lang-en">
          <li class="flex items-start space-x-2">
            <span class="text-alfa-red-600 font-bold">•</span>
            <span>Carefully curated and deduplicated <strong>4,449 files (421 MB total)</strong>.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start space-x-2">
            <span class="text-alfa-red-600 font-bold">•</span>
            <span>Recovered all high-resolution step photos and paired them with modern interactive lightbox galleries.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start space-x-2">
            <span class="text-alfa-red-600 font-bold">•</span>
            <span>Restored diagnostic audio recordings for Twin Spark cam variators and exhaust flexi leaks with native HTML5 players.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3: Modern Tech Stack -->
      <section class="space-y-4">
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl sm:text-3xl text-alfa-metal-900 dark:text-white">
          <span class="lang-it">Tecnologia & Prestazioni</span>
          <span class="lang-en">Technology & Architecture</span>
        </h2>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 pt-2">
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-alfa-metal-50 dark:bg-alfa-metal-950 border border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-800 space-y-1">
            <span class="font-display font-bold text-sm text-alfa-metal-900 dark:text-white">Astro 5 SSG</span>
            <p class="text-xs text-alfa-metal-600 dark:text-alfa-metal-400">
              <span class="lang-it">Pagine statiche pre-renderizzate per caricamenti fulminei e SEO 100/100.</span>
              <span class="lang-en">Pre-rendered static HTML for instantaneous page loads and perfect SEO scores.</span>
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-alfa-metal-50 dark:bg-alfa-metal-950 border border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-800 space-y-1">
            <span class="font-display font-bold text-sm text-alfa-metal-900 dark:text-white">Tailwind CSS & Alfa Design</span>
            <p class="text-xs text-alfa-metal-600 dark:text-alfa-metal-400">
              <span class="lang-it">Design ispirato al Rosso Alfa `#990000`, finiture metalliche scure e modalità chiara/scura istantanea.</span>
              <span class="lang-en">Rosso Alfa `#990000` accents, dark metallic asphalt finishes, and smooth light/dark toggle.</span>
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-alfa-metal-50 dark:bg-alfa-metal-950 border border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-800 space-y-1">
            <span class="font-display font-bold text-sm text-alfa-metal-900 dark:text-white">
              <span class="lang-it">Architettura Monorotta Bilingue</span>
              <span class="lang-en">Single-Route Bilingual i18n</span>
            </span>
            <p class="text-xs text-alfa-metal-600 dark:text-alfa-metal-400">
              <span class="lang-it">Cambio lingua immediato senza duplicare file o rotte, con persistenza locale.</span>
              <span class="lang-en">Instantaneous language toggle with zero route duplication and local storage memory.</span>
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-alfa-metal-50 dark:bg-alfa-metal-950 border border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-800 space-y-1">
            <span class="font-display font-bold text-sm text-alfa-metal-900 dark:text-white">Cloudflare Pages</span>
            <p class="text-xs text-alfa-metal-600 dark:text-alfa-metal-400">
              <span class="lang-it">Deploy continuo tramite GitHub per garantire uptime globale e sicurezza SSL automatica.</span>
              <span class="lang-en">Automated GitHub continuous deployment for high uptime and edge CDN speed.</span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4: Credits & Disclaimer -->
      <section class="pt-8 border-t border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-800 text-xs text-alfa-metal-500 space-y-3 leading-relaxed">
        <h4 class="font-display font-bold text-sm text-alfa-metal-700 dark:text-alfa-metal-300">
          <span class="lang-it">Note Legali e Ringraziamenti</span>
          <span class="lang-en">Legal Disclaimer & Acknowledgements</span>
        </h4>
        <p>
          <span class="lang-it">
            Questo sito è un tributo indipendente senza scopi di lucro realizzato per preservare la cultura automobilistica italiana. I marchi "Alfa Romeo", "156", "GTA", "Twin Spark", "Busso", "JTD", "JTS" e i relativi loghi appartengono a Stellantis N.V. e/o alle rispettive aziende proprietarie.
          </span>
          <span class="lang-en">
            This non-profit independent tribute website preserves Italian automotive heritage. Alfa Romeo, 156, GTA, Twin Spark, Busso, JTD, JTS and related emblems are registered trademarks of Stellantis N.V. and respective holders.
          </span>
        </p>
        <p>
          <span class="lang-it">
            Un ringraziamento speciale ad <strong>Anders</strong> per aver creato alfa156.net nel lontano 1999, a <strong>Jeff</strong> per i contributi tecnici e a tutti i membri storici della community che hanno fotografato e documentato i loro interventi d'officina.
          </span>
          <span class="lang-en">
            Special thanks to <strong>Anders</strong> for founding alfa156.net back in 1999, to <strong>Jeff</strong> for countless technical guides, and to all community members who documented their workshop adventures.
          </span>
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
